also called vertices,

7
00:00:17,922 --> 00:00:20,071
which are connected through edges.

8
00:00:20,896 --> 00:00:23,305
And the important thing is that a tree is

9
00:00:23,644 --> 00:00:24,614
unidirectional

10
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,916
from top to bottom. That every node can have

11
