12
00:00:30,916 --> 00:00:34,252
loops, no cycles in there, and we have clear

13
00:00:34,381 --> 00:00:37,364
directions, a clear hierarchy in our tree.

14
00:00:38,856 --> 00:00:41,759
Now a graph is kind of a tree

15
00:00:42,321 --> 00:00:44,454
but breaking all the tree rules.

16
00:00:45,112 --> 00:00:47,518
In a graph, we can have connections like

