22
00:00:59,650 --> 00:01:01,946
don't just have that parent-child relation.

23
00:01:02,524 --> 00:01:05,977
As you can see, even nodes on the same level

24
00:01:06,314 --> 00:01:08,417
can be connected to each other like

25
