-10 and 59 are here.

26
00:01:11,854 --> 00:01:14,519
We also can have bidirectional connections

27
00:01:14,808 --> 00:01:19,433
like here 10 and 59. 10 points at 59 but 59

28
00:01:19,625 --> 00:01:20,813
also points at 10

